---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="tovin Labs — 교육용 앱과 모바일 게임" lang="ko">
  <section class="px-6 pt-20 pb-16 max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center">
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight">
      재미있게 배우고,<br />즐겁게 놀자.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-[var(--color-fg-muted)] max-w-xl mx-auto">
      tovin Labs는 교육용 앱과 모바일 게임을 만드는 1인+AI 스튜디오입니다.
    </p>
    <a
      href="#products"
      class="inline-block mt-10 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-fg)] text-[var(--color-bg)] font-medium hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity"
    >
      제품 보기 ↓
    </a>
  </section>

  <section id="products" class="px-6 py-16 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-10">제품</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <article
        class="rounded-2xl bg-[var(--color-bg-alt)] border border-[var(--color-border)] p-8 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow"
      >
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--color-fg-muted)] mb-2">교육</p>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">コトバ Kotoba</h3>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">
          JLPT N5~N1 단어를 타이머로 집중 학습. 즉시 테스트 + 오답 재학습 루프.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">곧 출시</p>
      </article>
      <article
        class="rounded-2xl bg-[var(--color-bg-alt)] border border-[var(--color-border)] p-8 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow"
      >
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--color-fg-muted)] mb-2">게임</p>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Mochi Jump 모치 점프</h3>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">
          말랑말랑 모치와 하늘 끝까지. 7~13세 어린이를 위한 무한 점프 캐주얼 게임.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">곧 출시</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 py-16 max-w-5xl mx-auto border-t border-[var(--color-border)]">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4">About</h2>
      <p class="text-[var(--color-fg-muted)] leading-relaxed">
        tovin Labs는 한국에서 만든 작은 스튜디오입니다. 작지만 빠르게, 사용자에게 진심을 다해 배움과
        재미를 전달합니다.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">
        문의: <a href="mailto:hello@tovinlabs.com" class="text-[var(--color-fg)] underline">
          hello@tovinlabs.com
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
